  vs the previous campaign's rig: max_slot_wal_keep_size 6GB -> 12GB (the safety
  valve), max_wal_size 4GB -> 2GB, shared_buffers 128MB -> 1GB,
  max_connections 80 -> 200, checkpoint_timeout 30min -> 5min, synchronous_commit
  on -> off, wal_compression off (unchanged). Every one of these is a setting on
  the UNCAPPED source and changes nothing the capped container may do.

